    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Leŋo ma mic",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo gi Musa ka waco ni: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waci ri Aron kodi wote jowogwokere kwoŋ gigipiny maleŋ pa Joisiraili, ma jomiyan, ŋey jokiri jowokoci nyingan maleŋ. An abedo Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waci rijo ni, “I luse pajo je jacwo m'ocore cegin gi gigipiny maleŋ, ma Joisiraili jomiyo Rwoth, kareno go koc, ŋato ilakwanyo woko ruwaŋan: An abedo Rwoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wongoye jacwo m'obedo nyakwar Aron ma two dhowo kosa ma cwero tuti ma wocam gigipiny maleŋ cuka go lony. Ŋat'ogey gimoro je makoc m'otho kosa jacwo m'ojayo kwoŋe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kosa ŋat'ogey gima lak manyalo koco go kosa dhano manyalo miyo go bedo makoc, koco moro je ma go obedi gine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dhano m'ogey nger gino labedo makoc tundo othieno aka k'ocami gigipiny maleŋ kwanyowoko k'otieko lwoko delkwoŋe gi pi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka waŋceŋ otieko podho labedo m'olony; rumacen mere go nyaka nyalo camo gigipiny maleŋ, kwoŋbedo meno obedo cemo pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gima won otho kosa m'ogwaŋe am'oneko, go kiripi camo, koco kwo pere gine: An abedo Rwoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onyo riameno joripo kuro cik paran, kosa jolabedo gi reco, to jotho, ka jokoc. An abedo Rwoth, aketho jo gicen paka jomaleŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jakicar kiripi camo gimaleŋ. Japath ma bedo gi jacway ri Were i wi migam kosa ŋeca ma go opangisa jokiripi camo gimaleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka jacway ri Were i wi migam onyewo ŋeca paka lim pere gi pesa, ŋeca no nyalo camo; kodi jono je ma jonywole i ot pere bende jonyalo camo cemo pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyar jacway ri Were i wi migam onywomere gi jakicar go kiripi camo mic ma gigipiny maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To nyar jacway ri Were i wi migam m'obedo citho kosa oeye pa cwore, kosa ma k'onywol, to gik i ot pa bamere, paka munyo fodi soye, go nyalo camo cemo pa bamere, kucel wongoye jakicar moro ma wocam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka jacwo moro ocam gimaleŋ ma k'ogendera, go ripo culo acel wiy abic mere kwoŋe, to miyo jacway ri Were i wi migam gimaleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jocway ri Were i wi migam jokiripi koco gigipiny maleŋ pa Joisiraili, ma jomiyo Rwoth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lamiyo jo jowotimi banja ma mito mic ma culo banja, ka jocam gigipiny pajo maleŋ; kole An abedo Rwoth, aketho jo gicen paka jomaleŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo gi Musa ka waco ni: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Luw gi Aron gi wote kodi ji je ma Isiraili; k'acel kwoŋ Joisiraili kosa jokicar ma jobedo i dier Joisiraili okeli mic pere, obedi mic ma go ociko kosa mic ma go won oyere kelo m'imiyo Rwoth paka mic awaŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "go won ripo miyo, ma jacwo m'ongoye gi ŋolo, ma dhiaŋ kosa rombo kosa diel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 17:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri wimiy gimoro je manitie gi ŋolo, rupiri kilajolo rin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka ŋatimoro otimo cowirok ma siem ri Rwoth, ma culo cikirok pere kosa mic ma go won omiyo, wok kwoŋ dhok kosa mwendi, ripo bedo m'otire, ŋey wojol, m'ongoye gi ŋolo kwoŋe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimoro ma waŋ'otho, kosa m'omiy litho, kosa m'okol, kosa ma tuti cwer kwoŋe kosa ma two gwenyo kosa kasengo, wikiri wimiy Rwoth kosa wikethi wiwaŋ i wi migam paka mic awaŋa ri Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Merikwa kosa wod rombo ma tiende orwombere, winyalo miyo ri mic ma in won iyeyo miyo; to kilajolo ri mic m'iciko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwaŋ moro je m'oŋidhi nyangil mande kosa m'oŋiny kosa oyec kosa otoŋ, wikiri wimiy Rwoth; wikiri witim nger gino i piny mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikir'ijol nger ogwaŋe no wok i cingi jokicar ma miyo paka cemo ri Were perin; kwoŋbedo okol jo, aka jonitie gi ŋolo kwoŋ jo, kilajolo jo riwin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo gi Musa ka waco ni: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“K'onywol nyathi rwath kosa wod rombo kosa nyathi diel, wobedi ma ndelo abirio gi min, aka wok i ndelo mar'aboro kadho malo, ilajolo paka mic awaŋa ri Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka k'obedi min dhiaŋ kosa min rombo, wikiripi thumo kanyacel gi nyathi mere i ndelo acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka witimo cowirok ma foyo Rwoth, wiripo miyo i nger ma lamiyo wojol riwin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
