              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wocam gi ndelo no won; wikiri wiwey moro je wodoŋ tundo odikin: An abedo Rwoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
