              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri wikoci nyingan maleŋ, aka alanyutho leŋo paran i dier Joisiraili: An abedo Rwoth, aketho win gicen paka jomaleŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
